"double. Note that a face value of 1 automatically allows both\n"
"players to double."
msgstr ""
"Gosod gwerth wyneb y ciwb a dewis pwy ddylai\n"
"fod â'r gallu i ddyblu.  Noder: mae wynebwerth o 1\n"
"yn galluogi i'r ddau chwareuwr ddyblu."

